1
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:12,178
Hurry and get dressed.

2
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:16,080
It won't look good if someone sees you.

3
00:01:21,930 --> 00:01:26,652
You didn't think that way last night.

4
00:01:29,570 --> 00:01:32,941
What will you do from now on?

5
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:42,393
If telling the truth means losing you.

6
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:47,661
I'd rather die.

7
00:02:31,550 --> 00:02:32,984
Where did you go yesterday?

8
00:02:33,750 --> 00:02:35,052
I went out for a walk, sir.

9
00:02:37,410 --> 00:02:38,043
Yesterday?

10
00:02:38,067 --> 00:02:40,775
The weather was nice yesterday, so I went out for some fresh air.

11
00:02:46,910 --> 00:02:50,018
Don't go out alone next time.

12
00:03:15,390 --> 00:03:17,064
You don't have to make that face.

13
00:03:20,332 --> 00:03:21,876
But someone attacked you.

14
00:03:23,249 --> 00:03:24,873
I just don't want my dad to worry.

15
00:03:26,350 --> 00:03:28,689
It could be even more dangerous next time.

16
00:03:29,890 --> 00:03:33,360
Well, I have you to protect me, my guardian.

17
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:39,741
Promise me you won't let me out of your sight.

18
00:03:40,330 --> 00:03:42,609
Promise you won't ever leave me.

19
00:03:53,870 --> 00:03:54,603
I promise.

20
00:03:56,130 --> 00:04:00,153
Even so, I won't stop teasing you.

21
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:09,661
Walking this close to me... are you afraid I'll disappear?

22
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:12,473
I am merely staying alert for danger.

23
00:04:14,050 --> 00:04:15,809
Or do you just want to be close to me?

24
00:04:39,415 --> 00:04:42,566
There. This suits you well.

25
00:05:28,030 --> 00:05:29,667
You! Stop it!

26
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:32,153
A bodyguard must endure.

27
00:05:33,618 --> 00:05:34,338
Give it back.

28
00:05:35,370 --> 00:05:36,356
Give it back!

29
00:05:39,230 --> 00:05:39,981
Hey, you.

30
00:06:38,350 --> 00:06:41,600
Do you think those servants saw us?

31
00:06:44,290 --> 00:06:45,433
I don't care.

32
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,095
Let them see if they want to.

33
00:07:45,710 --> 00:07:49,969
You look more like yourself this way.

34
00:07:56,363 --> 00:08:01,329
It's fine. You don't have to feel tense around me.

35
00:08:03,052 --> 00:08:07,292
Everything will be a secret between the two of us.

36
00:08:14,215 --> 00:08:16,210
But right now...

37
00:08:22,547 --> 00:08:24,540
I want to test you on something.

38
00:08:28,770 --> 00:08:29,858
What are you testing?

39
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,667
Your concentration.

40
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,916
You love testing me.

41
00:08:37,710 --> 00:08:43,963
But lately… you seem to lose your focus whenever you're near me.

42
00:09:04,098 --> 00:09:05,089
You lose.

43
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:15,723
Honestly, I don't mean to tease you.

44
00:09:19,900 --> 00:09:23,249
I'm just happy whenever I'm near you.

45
00:09:27,790 --> 00:09:29,790
Just being close to you is enough.

46
00:09:50,406 --> 00:09:51,316
Khun Maen, sir!

47
00:09:52,820 --> 00:09:55,421
The lady's bodyguard is a woman.

48
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:56,916
How is that even possible?!

49
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:01,815
But actually, that's perfect.

50
00:10:02,640 --> 00:10:03,630
It makes things easier.

51
00:10:04,760 --> 00:10:08,578
Once we eliminate her, nothing will be left to protect Lady Rinkham.
